{"seq":1,"slug":"cbo-statistics-cost-model-join-reorder","title":"规则优化器与 CBO：统计信息采集、成本模型与 Join 重排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/trino-presto-distributed-federated-query-engine/optimizer-deployment-resource-ops/cbo-statistics-cost-model-join-reorder","wordCount":2321,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"规则优化器与-cbo-统计信息采集-成本模型与-join-重排序\">规则优化器与 CBO：统计信息采集、成本模型与 Join 重排序</h1><p>同样一条三表 Join，把顺序换一下，执行时间可能从 8 秒变成 40 秒——中间结果的<strong>基数</strong>被放大几个数量级，多出来的行要经过 Exchange 在网络上重分布。Trino 的优化器先用<strong>基于规则的改写</strong>（rule-based，如谓词下推、列裁剪、Cross Join 消除）把计划规范化，再用<strong>基于代价的优化</strong>（CBO）在多个候选 Join 顺序里挑代价最低的。CBO 的上游是<strong>统计信息</strong>——没有准确的 <code>row count</code>、<code>NDV</code> 与 <code>nulls fraction</code>，代价模型只能瞎猜。本文讲清统计从哪来、成本怎么算、Join 怎么重排。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-规则优化与-cbo-的分工\">核心概念：规则优化与 CBO 的分工</h2><p>Trino 优化器<strong>不是一个整体</strong>，而是两条依次执行的流水线。第一条是 <code>IterativeOptimizer</code>：把一组规则（<code>Rule&lt;PlanNode&gt;</code>）反复应用到逻辑计划树直到不再变化。规则本身<strong>不看代价</strong>，只做语义等价的局部改写——谓词下推、Join 消除、TopN 下推、去重聚合改写等。第二条才是 CBO：只处理规则流水线无法决策的部分，也就是「Join 按什么顺序、用什么分布方式」。它是<a href=\"../mpp-architecture-query-lifecycle/query-lifecycle-plan-analyze-state-machine\">查询生命周期</a>中 Analyze 阶段的展开。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    SQL[SQL 文本] --&gt; PARSE[Parse + Analyze&lt;br/&gt;逻辑计划 PlanNode 树]&#10;    PARSE --&gt; RULE[规则优化 IterativeOptimizer&lt;br/&gt;谓词下推 / 列裁剪 / Cross Join 消除]&#10;    RULE --&gt; STAT[读取连接器统计&lt;br/&gt;row count / NDV / nulls / min-max]&#10;    STAT --&gt; ENUM{join_reordering_strategy}&#10;    ENUM --&gt;|AUTOMATIC| CBO[枚举候选顺序&lt;br/&gt;代价模型打分选最低]&#10;    ENUM --&gt;|ELIMINATE_CROSS_JOINS| ECJ[仅消除 Cross Join]&#10;    ENUM --&gt;|NONE| NONE[保留语法顺序]&#10;    CBO --&gt; DIST[选分布方式&lt;br/&gt;PARTITIONED / BROADCAST]&#10;    ECJ --&gt; DIST&#10;    NONE --&gt; DIST&#10;    DIST --&gt; PHYS[物理计划&lt;br/&gt;Stage / Task / Split]\">flowchart TD\n    SQL[SQL 文本] --&gt; PARSE[Parse + Analyze&lt;br/&gt;逻辑计划 PlanNode 树]\n    PARSE --&gt; RULE[规则优化 IterativeOptimizer&lt;br/&gt;谓词下推 / 列裁剪 / Cross Join 消除]\n    RULE --&gt; STAT[读取连接器统计&lt;br/&gt;row count / NDV / nulls / min-max]\n    STAT --&gt; ENUM{join_reordering_strategy}\n    ENUM --&gt;|AUTOMATIC| CBO[枚举候选顺序&lt;br/&gt;代价模型打分选最低]\n    ENUM --&gt;|ELIMINATE_CROSS_JOINS| ECJ[仅消除 Cross Join]\n    ENUM --&gt;|NONE| NONE[保留语法顺序]\n    CBO --&gt; DIST[选分布方式&lt;br/&gt;PARTITIONED / BROADCAST]\n    ECJ --&gt; DIST\n    NONE --&gt; DIST\n    DIST --&gt; PHYS[物理计划&lt;br/&gt;Stage / Task / Split]</pre><p>区分点是「谁会因为统计不准而变差」。规则优化是<strong>语义驱动</strong>的，谓词能否下推由连接器 SPI 契约和表达式语义决定，不受统计影响；CBO 是<strong>数据驱动</strong>的，<code>join_reordering_strategy=AUTOMATIC</code>（默认）时读取表统计估算每张表过滤后的行数。若统计缺失或某条候选代价无法计算，Trino 会<strong>回退 <code>ELIMINATE_CROSS_JOINS</code></strong>，而不是给出可能错误的顺序（<a href=\"https://trino.io/docs/current/optimizer/cost-based-optimizations.html\">Trino Cost-Based Optimizations</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>规则优化（RBO）</th>\n<th>代价优化（CBO）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>决策依据</td>\n<td>算子语义等价性</td>\n<td>连接器提供的行数/NDV/空值率统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型任务</td>\n<td>谓词下推、列裁剪、Cross Join 消除</td>\n<td>Join 顺序、Join 分布（build/probe 选择）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖统计</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是，缺失则回退</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败模式</td>\n<td>下推机会静默丢失</td>\n<td>顺序选反、广播超阈值、中间结果爆炸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"统计信息采集-analyze-show-stats-与连接器契约\">统计信息采集：ANALYZE、SHOW STATS 与连接器契约</h2><p>统计信息的唯一来源是<strong>连接器</strong>。Trino 核心不自己扫表算统计，它调用 <code>ConnectorMetadata</code> 的统计接口，把返回的 <code>TableStatistics</code> 与列统计喂给优化器；连接器不支持就等于没有统计。查看统计用 <code>SHOW STATS</code>，刷新用 <code>ANALYZE</code>（<a href=\"https://trino.io/docs/current/optimizer/statistics.html\">Trino Table Statistics</a>）。<strong>表级</strong>只有 <code>row count</code>（总行数）；<strong>列级</strong>五项：<code>data size</code>、<code>nulls fraction</code>、<code>distinct value count</code>（NDV）、<code>low value</code> / <code>high value</code>。注意 <strong>Hive 连接器不提供 data-size 统计</strong>，基于字节的成本估算在该连接器上退化为基于行数的近似。</p>\n<p>刷新时机决定统计是否可信。连接器支持时 Trino 会在 <code>INSERT</code> / <code>UPDATE</code> / <code>DELETE</code> 时<strong>自动更新</strong>统计；数据在 Trino 之外被改动（例如 Spark 直接写 Iceberg 表），就必须手工跑 <code>ANALYZE</code> 重建（<a href=\"https://trino.io/docs/current/sql/analyze.html\">Trino ANALYZE</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"ANALYZE hive.sales.orders;                       -- 全列&#10;ANALYZE hive.sales.orders WITH (&#10;  partitions = ARRAY[ARRAY[&#39;2026-09-30&#39;]],        -- 只分析指定分区&#10;  columns    = ARRAY[&#39;customer_id&#39;,&#39;order_date&#39;]  -- 只分析 Join/过滤/分组键&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ANALYZE </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sales</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.orders;                       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 全列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ANALYZE </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sales</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  partitions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ARRAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[ARRAY['2026-09-30']],        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 只分析指定分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  columns    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ARRAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">['customer_id','order_date']  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 只分析 Join/过滤/分组键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>可用属性通过 <code>system.metadata.analyze_properties</code> 运行时查询。高频坑：宽表逐列分析代价很高，应只分析 <strong>Join 键、谓词列、分组键</strong>；若此前已对全列采集过统计，想改成只分析子集<strong>必须先删除旧统计</strong>（Hive 用 <code>CALL system.drop_stats(...)</code>，Iceberg 用 <code>ALTER TABLE ... EXECUTE drop_extended_stats</code>）。各连接器自动采集策略不同：Hive 总是采 <code>numFiles</code>/<code>numRows</code>/<code>rawDataSize</code>/<code>totalSize</code> 且列统计默认自动采（<code>hive.collect-column-statistics-on-write=true</code>）；Iceberg 写时采扩展统计（<code>iceberg.extended-statistics.collect-on-write=true</code>）。Hive 的列统计按类型分级：数值/日期/时间戳采 <code>null count</code> + <code>distinct count</code> + <code>min/max</code>，字符串类型只采 <code>null</code> 与 <code>distinct</code>（<a href=\"https://trino.io/docs/current/connector/hive.html\">Trino Hive Connector</a>）。硬限制：<strong>Trino 不为 Hive 事务表采集统计</strong>；<code>table-statistics-enabled=false</code> 只阻止优化器使用统计，并不停止采集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本模型-行数-字节与-explain-代价解读\">成本模型：行数、字节与 EXPLAIN 代价解读</h2><p>CBO 的核心是一个<strong>基数估算器</strong>加一个成本函数。基数从 TableScan 的统计出发逐算子向上传播。对过滤算子，输出行数是输入行数乘以<strong>选择率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{out}} = R_{\\text{in}} \\cdot s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s \\in [0, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。等值谓词 <code>col = c</code> 的基础估计是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>NDV</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s \\approx 1 / \\text{NDV}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NDV</span></span></span></span></span></span>；范围谓词用 min/max 插值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>max</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>min</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s \\approx \\frac{hi - lo}{\\text{max} - \\text{min}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2834em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">max</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>；<code>nulls fraction</code> 修正 <code>IS NULL</code> / <code>IS NOT NULL</code> 的选择率。</p>\n<p>难点在<strong>多个谓词叠加时的相关性</strong>。把 <code>WHERE a = 1 AND b = 2</code> 的选择率直接相乘会严重低估结果行数，因为真实数据里 <code>a</code> 和 <code>b</code> 往往相关。Trino 用两个<strong>独立性因子</strong>把乘积往回调：<code>optimizer.filter-conjunction-independence-factor</code>（默认 <code>0.75</code>）与 <code>optimizer.join-multi-clause-independence-factor</code>（默认 <code>0.25</code>）。因子越接近 1 越信任「独立相乘」，越接近 0 越倾向「谓词重叠，不会各自完整生效」。数据强相关时（如 <code>country</code> 与 <code>currency</code>），默认值可能仍高估过滤力度，把某侧表估得太小而选错 Join 顺序。</p>\n<p>Join 基数遵循包含度公式，对等值连接 <code>L.k = R.k</code>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>join</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>NDV</mtext><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>NDV</mtext><mi>R</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{join}} \\approx \\frac{R_L \\cdot R_R}{\\max(\\text{NDV}_L(k),\\ \\text{NDV}_R(k))}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">join</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4086em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8886em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">NDV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">NDV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">))</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4103em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。分母取两侧 Join 键 NDV 的较大值，本质是假设较小的 NDV 侧是较大侧的子集（包含度 = 1）。该假设在维表-事实表场景通常成立，但两侧都是事实表时会低估。<strong>NDV 的准确度直接决定 Join 基数的准确度。</strong></p>\n<p>代价显示在 <code>EXPLAIN</code>，格式 <code>{rows: XX (XX), cpu: XX, memory: XX, network: XX}</code>（<a href=\"https://trino.io/docs/current/optimizer/cost-in-explain.html\">Trino Cost in EXPLAIN</a>）：<code>rows</code> 是该节点<strong>输出</strong>行数，括号里是输出字节量（如 <code>1.69kB</code>）；<code>cpu</code>/<code>memory</code>/<code>network</code> 是<strong>无量纲抽象代价</strong>，只用于比较计划相对高低；未知值显示 <code>?</code>。若 TableScan 的 <code>rows</code> 与实际行数差一个数量级，说明统计过期或缺失，<strong>先修统计再看计划</strong>；若 TableScan 估得准但上层 Join 的 <code>rows</code> 膨胀离谱，问题在包含度假设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"join-重排序与分布选择-枚举-build-probe-与广播上限\">Join 重排序与分布选择：枚举、build/probe 与广播上限</h2><p>Trino 用哈希 Join：<strong>build side</strong> 构造哈希表，<strong>probe side</strong> 被逐行扫描去匹配。谁做 build 由优化器枚举决定——它枚举候选 Join 顺序，用上节的成本模型打分，选代价最低的。这由 <code>optimizer.join-reordering-strategy</code> 控制：<code>AUTOMATIC</code>（默认，完整自动枚举）、<code>ELIMINATE_CROSS_JOINS</code>（只消除 Cross Join，保留书写顺序）、<code>NONE</code>（完全保留语法顺序）。枚举规模上限 <code>optimizer.max-reordered-joins</code>（默认 <code>8</code>），超过的 Join 不再全排列，避免优化阶段本身成为瓶颈。与之正交的是<strong>分布方式</strong>，由 <code>join_distribution_type</code> 控制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分布类型</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>PARTITIONED</code></td>\n<td>两侧都按 Join 键哈希重分布，每节点各持一部分 build 表</td>\n<td>build 表很大，单机内存放不下</td>\n<td>额外网络 Shuffle</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BROADCAST</code></td>\n<td>build 表<strong>完整复制</strong>到每个节点</td>\n<td>build 侧远小于 probe 侧</td>\n<td>每节点内存须装下 build 表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AUTOMATIC</code>（默认）</td>\n<td>逐 Join 自动选择</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>AUTOMATIC</code> 下有一个硬性安全阀：<code>join_max_broadcast_table_size</code>（默认 <strong>100 MB</strong>）。只要重排或分布选择<strong>任一为自动</strong>，某张表过滤后估算超过 100 MB 就不会被广播，退化为分区 Join。这个阈值<strong>保护集群并发度</strong>：广播表虽加速单个查询，但复制到每个节点放大内存压力。CBO 关闭、走语法顺序时，Trino 内存哈希 Join 会把<strong>最右边的表当作 build side</strong>，官方建议写 Join 时<strong>从大表到小表排列</strong>，但这只是实现细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"统计缺失-联邦查询与自适应重排\">统计缺失、联邦查询与自适应重排</h2><p>真实生产里 CBO 最常见的失效不是算法错，而是<strong>前置数据缺失</strong>。跨源联邦把它放大：不同 catalog 统计质量天差地别，一个 Iceberg 维表有完整扩展统计，一个 JDBC 外表可能只有粗略估计甚至没有，优化器要么回退 <code>ELIMINATE_CROSS_JOINS</code>，要么基于垃圾统计给出错误顺序。诊断顺序：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>统计缺失或过期</strong>——<code>SHOW STATS</code> 的 <code>row count</code> 为 <code>?</code> 或明显偏离实际。在写入侧开启自动采集、对关键列跑 <code>ANALYZE</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>独立性因子不匹配数据分布</strong>——TableScan 与 Join 都估得合理但结果仍差。调两个 independence-factor，或改写 SQL 拆开相关谓词。</li>\n<li><strong>广播被阈值截断</strong>——期望广播的维表因估算超 100 MB 走了分区 Join。先确认统计是否把该表估大。</li>\n<li><strong>顺序确实选错</strong>——优化器无统计可用时，可考虑 <code>ELIMINATE_CROSS_JOINS</code> 配合手工书写顺序。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>缓解缺失统计的机制是<strong>自适应重排</strong>。开启容错执行（fault-tolerant execution）后，Trino 提供基于运行期统计动态调整计划的自适应优化，其中<strong>分区 Join 的自适应重排序默认启用</strong>：它不依赖事前统计，而在执行时用 build 侧与 probe 侧的<strong>实际大小</strong>重新决定顺序（<a href=\"https://trino.io/docs/current/optimizer/adaptive-plan-optimizations.html\">Trino Adaptive Plan Optimizations</a>）。总开关 <code>fault-tolerant-execution-adaptive-query-planning-enabled</code> 设 <code>false</code> 关闭<strong>全部</strong>自适应优化；单独关闭用 <code>fault-tolerant-execution-adaptive-join-reordering-enabled=false</code>。它只在启用容错执行时可用，不能替代统计，只是兜底。这条链路与<a href=\"../connector-spi-federation/predicate-pushdown-partition-pruning-dynamic-filter\">谓词下推与分区裁剪</a>是一体两面：下推决定「读多少」，统计决定「读到多少行、Join 顺序」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>规则优化和 CBO 是两条流水线</strong>：前者做语义等价的局部改写，不看代价；后者只用统计驱动 Join 顺序与分布选择，默认 <code>optimizer.join-reordering-strategy=AUTOMATIC</code>，缺失统计则回退 <code>ELIMINATE_CROSS_JOINS</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>统计来自连接器</strong>，表级 <code>row count</code> + 列级 <code>data size</code>/<code>nulls fraction</code>/<code>NDV</code>/<code>low-high value</code>。<code>SHOW STATS</code> 看、<code>ANALYZE</code> 刷；数据在 Trino 外改动后必须手工重建。Hive 默认采列统计但不提供 data-size，Iceberg 默认采扩展统计。</li>\n<li><strong>成本模型 = 基数估算 + 成本函数</strong>。等值选择率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>NDV</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s \\approx 1/\\text{NDV}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NDV</span></span></span></span></span></span>，多谓词合取靠独立性因子（<code>0.75</code> / <code>0.25</code>）避免过度低估；Join 基数近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>NDV</mtext><mi>L</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>NDV</mtext><mi>R</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_L R_R / \\max(\\text{NDV}_L,\\text{NDV}_R)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NDV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NDV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span